<h1>Gemma 4 31B-IT Deployment Analysis via AEX Model Service</h1>


<table style="width:60%; margin-bottom:20pt;">
<tr><td style="width:40%; font-weight:bold; background:#E8E8E8;">User Story</td><td>2748133 - Explore deployment of Gemma model</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-weight:bold; background:#E8E8E8;">Model</td><td>google/gemma-4-31b-it</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-weight:bold; background:#E8E8E8;">Sprint</td><td>Cat Digital 2026 | Sprint 12 (Jun 10 - Jun 23)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-weight:bold; background:#E8E8E8;">Owner</td><td>Sowndarya Kurapati</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-weight:bold; background:#E8E8E8;">Date</td><td>June 18, 2026</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-weight:bold; background:#E8E8E8;">AWS Region</td><td>us-east-2 (Ohio)</td></tr>
<tr><td style="font-weight:bold; background:#E8E8E8;">Pricing Type</td><td>On-Demand</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>1. Model Specifications</h2>
<table>
<tr><th>Specification</th><th>Value</th></tr>
<tr><td>Model Name</td><td>google/gemma-4-31b-it</td></tr>
<tr><td>Parameters</td><td>31 Billion (Dense)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Model Size on Disk (BF16)</td><td>~65 GB</td></tr>
<tr><td>VRAM Required (FP16/BF16)</td><td>~71 GB</td></tr>
<tr><td>VRAM Required (NVFP4 Quantized)</td><td>~45 GB</td></tr>
<tr><td>Minimum GPU</td><td>1x NVIDIA A100 80GB or 2x A100 40GB (tensor parallel)</td></tr>
<tr><td>Recommended Serving Engine</td><td>vLLM v0.8.0+</td></tr>
<tr><td>Context Length</td><td>Up to 256K tokens</td></tr>
<tr><td>Source</td><td>JFrog Artifactory (artifacts.cat.com) - Approved</td></tr>
<tr><td>Artifactory Path</td><td>cat-huggingface-repo/models/google/gemma-4-31B-it/</td></tr>
</table>


<h2>2. AWS Deployment Options via AEX Model Service</h2>
<p>The CMAAI-Model-Service workflow supports 5 model-types. The following AWS deployment paths are relevant for Gemma 4 31B:</p>
<table>
<tr><th>#</th><th>AWS Deployment Path</th><th>AEX model-type</th><th>Can Deploy Gemma 4 31B?</th><th>Primary Blocker</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>Amazon SageMaker Endpoint</td><td>sagemaker</td><td class="warn">MAYBE (best chance)</td><td>65 GB tar.gz packaging; no GPU instance selection</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td>Amazon ECS on EC2 with GPU</td><td>huggingface</td><td class="fail">NO</td><td>Storage 20 GiB &lt; 65 GB; ECR 52 GB limit; No GPU on Fargate</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td>Amazon Bedrock</td><td>N/A (not in workflow)</td><td class="fail">NO</td><td>Gemma 4 not available on Bedrock (only Gemma v3)</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td>LLM Object (unknown AWS infra)</td><td>llmobject</td><td class="warn">UNKNOWN</td><td>Undocumented - needs investigation</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>3. OPTION 1: Amazon SageMaker (AEX model-type = "sagemaker")</h2>
<h3>How It Works</h3>
<p>Model is packaged as model.tar.gz, uploaded to Amazon S3, and deployed to a SageMaker real-time inference endpoint.</p>
<h3>Feasibility Assessment</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Requirement</th><th>AWS SageMaker Capability</th><th>Gemma 4 31B Needs</th><th>Status</th></tr>
<tr><td>Model packaging (tar.gz)</td><td>S3 multipart upload, no hard size limit</td><td>65 GB tar.gz</td><td class="warn">POSSIBLE but very slow</td></tr>
<tr><td>Storage on endpoint</td><td>Configurable EBS volume</td><td>65+ GB</td><td class="pass">PASS</td></tr>
<tr><td>GPU availability</td><td>ml.g5, ml.p4d, ml.p5 instance families</td><td>A100 80GB min for FP16</td><td class="pass">PASS</td></tr>
<tr><td>Cold start</td><td>Instance launch + model load</td><td>5-15 minutes total</td><td class="warn">SLOW but acceptable</td></tr>
<tr><td>Inference timeout</td><td>Up to 60 seconds (real-time)</td><td>Depends on output length</td><td class="warn">RISK for long outputs</td></tr>
</table>


<h3>Problems Blocking This Path</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>#</th><th>Problem</th><th>Detail</th><th>Severity</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td class="fail">No staging infrastructure for 65 GB file operations</td><td>Need a server to download from JFrog (65 GB), compress to tar.gz, and upload to S3. No such server exists today.</td><td>CRITICAL</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td class="fail">65 GB tar.gz packaging impractical</td><td>Safetensors files do not compress well. Creating tar.gz takes hours and produces nearly same size.</td><td>HIGH</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td class="warn">No GPU instance type selection in workflow</td><td>Workflow only has deploy-on-gpu=true/false. Cannot specify ml.p4d.24xlarge or ml.g5.12xlarge.</td><td>HIGH</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td class="warn">No JFrog to S3 automated transfer</td><td>No pipeline to move 65 GB from JFrog Artifactory to AEX S3 bucket. Lambda limited to 10 GB.</td><td>HIGH</td></tr>
</table>

